# Only first-party production sources, embedded assets and Cargo manifests enter
# the build context. Tests, validation runs, databases and credentials stay out.
**
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!crates/*/
!crates/*/Cargo.toml
!crates/*/src/
!crates/*/src/**
!crates/*/assets/
!crates/*/assets/**
!fixtures/
!fixtures/tomcat-10.1.26-upload-idle-400.html
!docs/
!docs/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt
!docs/DEPENDENCY-LICENSES.json
# Last-match safeguards also apply inside otherwise allowed source/asset paths.
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/*.key
**/private*.pem
**/.env
